   Definitions
  ************/

  function IntervalSampleIsIndepFunctionHelper(a: int, x: int): nat
    requires x-a >= 0
  {
    x-a
  }

  ghost function IntervalSampleIsIndepFunctionHelperLifted(a: int, A: iset<int>): iset<nat>
